WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
A divided town couldn't land one clear accusation.

2
00:00:04.065 --> 00:00:05.680
The culprit kept their cover,

3
00:00:05.785 --> 00:00:07.360
and the core stayed hidden.

4
00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:10.240
The screen has the answer, the votes,

5
00:00:10.425 --> 00:00:12.320
and the trail you can follow back.

6
00:00:12.785 --> 00:00:15.600
Settle your friendly arguments with the evidence, partners.
